          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehosafati okoba omorwoti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehosafati, omwana omomura bw’Asa, akaba okogamba ase ribaga riaye. Agakong’ia oborwoti bwaye ase ogwekengera ase Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabeka abasikari ase emechie yonsi y’Abayuda yagiteire chindwaki, na ase ense y’Abayuda, na ase emechie y’Efraimu eyio Asa ise abwate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akaba amo na Yehosafati, ekiagera abwatetie chinchera chi’eritang’ani chia Daudi, sokoro yaye. Ere tasasimete Baali,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende akaba okorigia Nyasae o ise, na akabwata amachiiko ’Omonene, na tabwatetie chinchera chi’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Omonene agakora oborwoti bwaye bokaba ne chinguru ase okoboko kwaye, na Abayuda bonsi bakamorentera ebiegwa, ere akaba nobonda obonge na amasikani amanene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaba omoremu ase chinchera chi’Omonene, agasaria aase aimokererete igoro agosasimerwa, na akarusia emete y’Asera, enyasae eria enkungu, korwa ase Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka o gatato bw’okogamba kwaye, agatoma abanene b’obogambi bwaye, Beni‐Haili, na Obadia, na Zakaria, na Netaneli, na Mikaya, kworokereria ase emechie y’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amo nabanene baria agatoma Abalawi aba: Semaya, na Netania, na Sebadia, na Asaeli, na Semiramoti, na Yehonathani, na Adonia, na Tobia, na Tobi‐Adonia. Naende amo n’Abalawi aba agatoma Elisama na Yehoramu abakuani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bakaimokia egetabu y’ogochika kw’Omonene, bakagenda ase emechie yonsi y’Abayuda, bakorokereria abanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obonene bwa Yehosafati",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akoboyia amarwoti onsi ye chinse chiaetanaine Abayuda, na onde tacha korwania Yehosafati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafirisiti bande bakarenta ebiegwa ase Yehosafati, amo ne chifeta chikaba ebango. Abaarabu boigo bakamorentera chimingichi chilifu isano na ibere, na amagana atano na abere (7,700), ne chigoree chilifu isano na ibere, na amagana atano na abere (7,700).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehosafati akamenta koba ne chinguru, na agwo ase ense y’Abayuda akaagacha chiburi na emechie, ase arenge kogaacha ebinto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo abwate ebinto ebinge biagachire ase ense y’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naende nabwate abasikari, abanto chituoni, agwo Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo noro orenge omooroberio obo, eamate ase eamate. Korwa ase Abayuda nigo barenge abateneneri aba b’abasikari chilifu: Adina, omochiki amo nabarwani baye chituoni chilifu amagana atato (300,000).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na oyo o kabere Yehohanani omochiki amo nabarwani baye chituoni chilifu amagana abere na emerongo etano na etato (280,000);",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na oyo o gatato Amasia, mosinto o Sikiri, oyo bweruete ase ogwancha gokora emeremo y’Omonene; ere nigo abwate abarwani chituoni chilifu amagana abere (200,000).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa ase Ababenjamini nigo arenge Eliada, omonto etuoni; ere nigo abwate abarwani chilifu amagana abere (200,000), babwate amata ne chinguba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na oyo o kabere, Yehosabadi, obwate abarwani chilifu rigana erimo na emerongo etano na etato (180,000), babwate ebirwanero ase okorwana esegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto aba bakaba bagokora emeremo y’omorwoti amo na baria bande abegete ase emechie yagiteire chindwaki ase ense yonsi y’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
